  * Reports: F12 Data1, 8 bytes per object (type, x lo/hi, y lo/hi, z, wx,
  * wy) at the F12 data base, panel pixels 1080x1920. Only IC write: the RMI
  * page select register.
+ *
+ * The two capacitive keys beside the home button are F1A (page 2, data
+ * byte 0: bit 1 left, bit 0 right, as the OnePlus s3508 driver reads them).
+ * Right = iPhone Home (HID Menu; a double press opens the app switcher),
+ * left = Back, sent as a quick swipe in from the left edge (UIKit's back
+ * gesture). Boot-arg sweetkeyswap=1 swaps the two.
